Package: colombiaeducationcctreplication
Type: Project
Title: Reproducible Baseline Replication of a Colombian CCT Experiment
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Reproduces a transparent subset of the published attendance regressions
    using the authors' official replication data. The legacy machine-learning scripts
    are retained for historical reference but are not the canonical workflow.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    haven,
    lmtest,
    sandwich
